OL,3,GNEWSAHitman prisoner convicted of taxi
OL,4,Adriver murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hitman who shot dead a taxi driver
OL,7,Fhas been found guilty of murder while
OL,8,Fserving a life sentence for another
OL,9,Fcontract killing.
OL,11,FDavid Harrison, 77, was convicted at
OL,12,FWolverhampton Crown Court on Thursday
OL,13,Fover the death of father-of-four Harun
OL,14,FKhan in Tipton, West Midlands, on 3
OL,15,FMarch 2008.
OL,17,FHarrison, who refused to attend his
OL,18,Ftrial, is due to be sentenced on
OL,19,FTuesday.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
