OL,5,
OL,6,FAs part of those proceedings, jurors
OL,7,Falso found Harrison guilty of wounding
OL,8,Fanother man in a shooting on Dudley's
OL,9,FThornleigh trading estate in 2007 and
OL,10,Ftwo firearms offences relating to
OL,11,Falleged possession of a 7.65mm
OL,12,Fself-loading pistol in March 2008 and
OL,13,Fof a shotgun in December 2007.
